00:58:31.000 --> 00:58:33.000
So it's a rhetorical question.

00:58:33.000 --> 00:58:35.000
It's not a real question.

00:58:35.000 --> 00:58:37.000
That sense is rhetorical.

00:58:37.000 --> 00:58:39.000
Yes.

00:58:39.000 --> 00:58:41.000
But by asking the question

00:58:41.000 --> 00:58:43.000
alerts you about the distance

00:58:43.000 --> 00:58:45.000
that there is between God

00:58:45.000 --> 00:58:47.000
and the people.

00:58:47.000 --> 00:58:49.000
In their mind

00:58:49.000 --> 00:58:51.000
he's away.

00:58:51.000 --> 00:58:53.000
In the mind of the Rishain.

00:58:53.000 --> 00:58:55.000
Mr. Rishain.

00:58:55.000 --> 00:58:57.000
Yes.

00:58:57.000 --> 00:58:59.000
Mr. Rishain.

00:58:59.000 --> 00:59:01.000
But what is great about their book

00:59:01.000 --> 00:59:03.000
is that

00:59:03.000 --> 00:59:05.000
now you understand Mr. Rishain.

00:59:07.000 --> 00:59:09.000
You understand.

00:59:09.000 --> 00:59:11.000
Close to the mind of Mr. Rishain.

00:59:23.000 --> 00:59:25.000
The politicians

00:59:25.000 --> 00:59:27.000
don't...

00:59:31.000 --> 00:59:33.000
Now.

00:59:33.000 --> 00:59:35.000
The handbook.

00:59:43.000 --> 00:59:45.000
Right.

00:59:45.000 --> 00:59:47.000
Whatever he is

00:59:47.000 --> 00:59:49.000
Mr. Rishain

00:59:49.000 --> 00:59:51.000
is in

00:59:51.000 --> 00:59:53.000
ma'arav.

00:59:53.000 --> 00:59:55.000
Ma'arav means

00:59:55.000 --> 00:59:57.000
he is...

00:59:57.000 --> 00:59:59.000
When you are waiting for somebody.

00:59:59.000 --> 01:00:01.000
Ambush.

01:00:01.000 --> 01:00:03.000
You are ambushing somebody.

01:00:03.000 --> 01:00:05.000
Could be

01:00:05.000 --> 01:00:07.000
Hassanin.

01:00:07.000 --> 01:00:09.000
Could be in the open city.

01:00:09.000 --> 01:00:11.000
Or could be

01:00:11.000 --> 01:00:13.000
Mr. Rishain.

01:00:13.000 --> 01:00:15.000
No matter where you are.

01:00:15.000 --> 01:00:17.000
You are in the city.

01:00:17.000 --> 01:00:19.000
Or you are

01:00:19.000 --> 01:00:21.000
Mr. Vito.

01:00:21.000 --> 01:00:23.000
Always your mind

01:00:23.000 --> 01:00:25.000
is trapping others.

01:00:25.000 --> 01:00:27.000
The mindset of Rasha

01:00:27.000 --> 01:00:29.000
is how

01:00:29.000 --> 01:00:31.000
I trap

01:00:31.000 --> 01:00:33.000
this fool

01:00:33.000 --> 01:00:35.000
born every moment

01:00:35.000 --> 01:00:37.000
or every hour.

01:00:37.000 --> 01:00:39.000
Sucker born every second.

01:00:39.000 --> 01:00:41.000
He is thinking.

01:00:41.000 --> 01:00:43.000
He thinks of

01:00:43.000 --> 01:00:45.000
whom a guy I can trick

01:00:45.000 --> 01:00:47.000
today.

01:00:47.000 --> 01:00:49.000
He is Hassanin in the open city.

01:00:49.000 --> 01:00:51.000
Or he is

01:00:51.000 --> 01:00:53.000
in a small environment.

01:00:53.000 --> 01:00:55.000
A close environment.

01:00:55.000 --> 01:00:57.000
His mindset is

01:00:57.000 --> 01:00:59.000
how will I get

01:00:59.000 --> 01:01:01.000
this guy.

01:01:01.000 --> 01:01:03.000
In his mind

01:01:03.000 --> 01:01:05.000
is Mr. Rasha.

01:01:05.000 --> 01:01:07.000
He is thinking how to trap others.

01:01:07.000 --> 01:01:09.000
All right?

01:01:09.000 --> 01:01:11.000
He is not a crook.

01:01:13.000 --> 01:01:15.000
He is manipulating them left and right.

01:01:17.000 --> 01:01:19.000
Crooks are his victims.

01:01:19.000 --> 01:01:21.000
He is a victim.

01:01:21.000 --> 01:01:23.000
Mr. Rasha

01:01:24.000 --> 01:01:26.000
No.

01:01:26.000 --> 01:01:28.000
But he will give some money

01:01:28.000 --> 01:01:30.000
to improve the things

01:01:30.000 --> 01:01:32.000
of his people.

01:01:32.000 --> 01:01:34.000
Mr. Rasha.

01:01:34.000 --> 01:01:36.000
Mr. Rasha is a god.

01:01:36.000 --> 01:01:38.000
Of course.

01:01:38.000 --> 01:01:40.000
Yes.

01:01:40.000 --> 01:01:42.000
Earlier on you said

01:01:42.000 --> 01:01:44.000
that in this context

01:01:44.000 --> 01:01:46.000
it is regarding the government.

01:01:46.000 --> 01:01:48.000
I believe so.

01:01:48.000 --> 01:01:50.000
He is talking about the

01:01:51.000 --> 01:01:53.000
What government was he talking about?

01:01:53.000 --> 01:01:55.000
Government of Shaul?

01:01:55.000 --> 01:01:57.000
No.

01:01:57.000 --> 01:01:59.000
Government in general.

01:01:59.000 --> 01:02:01.000
Every government is the same way.

01:02:01.000 --> 01:02:03.000
The point of

01:02:03.000 --> 01:02:05.000
the point of David

01:02:05.000 --> 01:02:07.000
and Melech

01:02:07.000 --> 01:02:09.000
David and Melech

01:02:09.000 --> 01:02:11.000
he began with an idea

01:02:11.000 --> 01:02:13.000
that has no precedent.

01:02:13.000 --> 01:02:15.000
Is that you have to have a Melech

01:02:15.000 --> 01:02:17.000
under the law.

01:02:17.000 --> 01:02:19.000
Following the law.

01:02:20.000 --> 01:02:22.000
And that is why he is the Messiah.

01:02:22.000 --> 01:02:24.000
Because in what way

01:02:24.000 --> 01:02:26.000
the Messiah is different than anybody else?

01:02:26.000 --> 01:02:28.000
Because the Messiah

01:02:28.000 --> 01:02:30.000
is going to be a ruler

01:02:30.000 --> 01:02:32.000
under the law.

01:02:34.000 --> 01:02:36.000
And that is the uniqueness of the Melech

01:02:36.000 --> 01:02:38.000
the Messiah.

01:02:38.000 --> 01:02:40.000
Of course

01:02:40.000 --> 01:02:42.000
the other one walked on water.

01:02:42.000 --> 01:02:44.000
Very nice.

01:02:44.000 --> 01:02:46.000
But for a nation

01:02:46.000 --> 01:02:48.000
to thrive we need not

01:02:48.000 --> 01:02:50.000
a president who walks on water

01:02:50.000 --> 01:02:52.000
but a president who is

01:02:52.000 --> 01:02:54.000
under the law.

01:02:54.000 --> 01:02:56.000
Alright?

01:02:56.000 --> 01:02:58.000
Very good.

01:03:04.000 --> 01:03:06.000
So

01:03:06.000 --> 01:03:08.000
Yeshev

01:03:08.000 --> 01:03:10.000
Yeshev be'ma'arav

01:03:10.000 --> 01:03:12.000
Be'ma'arav haserim?

01:03:12.000 --> 01:03:14.000
O be'mistarim?

01:03:14.000 --> 01:03:16.000
Yaron haki

01:03:16.000 --> 01:03:18.000
Ya'arav le'halecha

01:03:18.000 --> 01:03:20.000
v'sponu

01:03:20.000 --> 01:03:22.000
Ya'arav le'halecha

01:03:22.000 --> 01:03:24.000
No!

01:03:24.000 --> 01:03:26.000
He would clean an innocent person.

01:03:26.000 --> 01:03:28.000
He doesn't care about

01:03:28.000 --> 01:03:30.000
an innocent person.

01:03:30.000 --> 01:03:32.000
Now, you have to tell me when to stop.

01:03:32.000 --> 01:03:34.000
Ha'alecha

01:03:34.000 --> 01:03:36.000
Ha'alecha is a difficult word

01:03:36.000 --> 01:03:38.000
because it appears only twice

01:03:38.000 --> 01:03:40.000
or three times in the whole Tanakh.

01:03:40.000 --> 01:03:42.000
And let me tell you

01:03:42.000 --> 01:03:44.000
what I

01:03:46.000 --> 01:03:48.000
my interpretation.

01:03:48.000 --> 01:03:50.000
To be right, nobody else

01:03:50.000 --> 01:03:52.000
would speak this.

01:03:52.000 --> 01:03:54.000
In my opinion, the word ha'alecha means

01:03:54.000 --> 01:03:56.000
his victims.

01:03:56.000 --> 01:03:58.000
The person who is underneath.

01:03:58.000 --> 01:04:00.000
The lowest of the lowest.

01:04:00.000 --> 01:04:02.000
There is ubermensch,

01:04:02.000 --> 01:04:04.000
there is untermensch.

01:04:04.000 --> 01:04:06.000
The low, yes.

01:04:06.000 --> 01:04:08.000
The low, yes.

01:04:08.000 --> 01:04:10.000
Ya'arav le'halecha

01:04:10.000 --> 01:04:12.000
v'sponu. He looks

01:04:12.000 --> 01:04:14.000
how to lower somebody.

01:04:14.000 --> 01:04:16.000
Lower somebody.

01:04:18.000 --> 01:04:20.000
This guy is good

01:04:20.000 --> 01:04:22.000
but he has

01:04:22.000 --> 01:04:24.000
too much power.

01:04:26.000 --> 01:04:28.000
Lower him a little bit.

01:04:30.000 --> 01:04:32.000
Make him too much money.

01:04:32.000 --> 01:04:34.000
You make him too much money.

01:04:36.000 --> 01:04:38.000
Less money.

01:04:38.000 --> 01:04:40.000
Yes, there is only this.

01:04:40.000 --> 01:04:42.000
You do also this.

01:04:42.000 --> 01:04:44.000
Le'halecha.

01:04:44.000 --> 01:04:46.000
Lower him a little bit.

01:04:46.000 --> 01:04:48.000
These people.

01:04:48.000 --> 01:04:50.000
I'm not in here

01:04:50.000 --> 01:04:52.000
against this but you're making too much money.

01:04:54.000 --> 01:04:56.000
These other people are making nothing.

01:04:58.000 --> 01:05:00.000
These people.

01:05:02.000 --> 01:05:04.000
Le'halecha.

01:05:06.000 --> 01:05:08.000
Bring him down.

01:05:08.000 --> 01:05:10.000
Tax the rich.

01:05:10.000 --> 01:05:12.000
What?

01:05:12.000 --> 01:05:14.000
Oh, tax the rich.

01:05:14.000 --> 01:05:16.000
Tax the rich.

01:05:16.000 --> 01:05:18.000
But you know why?

01:05:18.000 --> 01:05:20.000
It's not good to have too much money.

01:05:20.000 --> 01:05:22.000
Bring them down.

01:05:22.000 --> 01:05:24.000
People who make money

01:05:24.000 --> 01:05:26.000
have a problem because

01:05:26.000 --> 01:05:28.000
they're poor people. You know those people who have bumps

01:05:28.000 --> 01:05:30.000
in the streets and so on. They live up to their bills

01:05:30.000 --> 01:05:32.000
and they have 25 children and

01:05:32.000 --> 01:05:34.000
12 wives and so on.

01:05:34.000 --> 01:05:36.000
These are good people.

01:05:36.000 --> 01:05:38.000
You're taking it seriously.

01:05:40.000 --> 01:05:42.000
Don't take me seriously, please.

01:05:42.000 --> 01:05:44.000
There are people who do take it seriously.

01:05:44.000 --> 01:05:46.000
That's the problem.

01:05:46.000 --> 01:05:48.000
Not you.

01:05:48.000 --> 01:05:50.000
I'm not laughing at them.

01:05:50.000 --> 01:05:52.000
Please.

01:05:52.000 --> 01:05:54.000
And they say these type of statements.

01:05:54.000 --> 01:05:56.000
There are people who take it

01:05:56.000 --> 01:05:58.000
at face value.

01:05:58.000 --> 01:06:00.000
They get really

01:06:00.000 --> 01:06:02.000
misled.

01:06:02.000 --> 01:06:04.000
47%.

01:06:04.000 --> 01:06:06.000
Don't say they live.

01:06:06.000 --> 01:06:08.000
The studies you study,

01:06:08.000 --> 01:06:10.000
they live. Our grandparents,

01:06:10.000 --> 01:06:12.000
they didn't go to Harvard, they didn't

01:06:12.000 --> 01:06:14.000
study and have a BA in this,

01:06:14.000 --> 01:06:16.000
but they lived and lived.

01:06:16.000 --> 01:06:18.000
So did most Americans.

01:06:18.000 --> 01:06:20.000
Once

01:06:20.000 --> 01:06:22.000
at the time. But they had it

01:06:22.000 --> 01:06:24.000
in English. It doesn't sound the same.

01:06:24.000 --> 01:06:26.000
All right?

01:06:26.000 --> 01:06:28.000
But I don't think you could have

01:06:28.000 --> 01:06:30.000
the demagogue

01:06:30.000 --> 01:06:32.000
that he's referring to.

01:06:32.000 --> 01:06:34.000
In America,

01:06:34.000 --> 01:06:36.000
unless the other grandchildren

01:06:36.000 --> 01:06:38.000
abandon them, right?

01:06:38.000 --> 01:06:40.000
Of course.

01:06:40.000 --> 01:06:42.000
Of course.

01:06:42.000 --> 01:06:44.000
And that's why, you know,

01:06:44.000 --> 01:06:46.000
we should have a special

01:06:46.000 --> 01:06:48.000
when they apply for

01:06:48.000 --> 01:06:50.000
tax exemption status,

01:06:50.000 --> 01:06:52.000
we have to do

01:06:52.000 --> 01:06:54.000
twice or three times on them.

01:06:54.000 --> 01:06:56.000
They're dangerous people.

01:06:56.000 --> 01:06:58.000
All right?

01:06:58.000 --> 01:07:00.000
Don't take me

01:07:00.000 --> 01:07:02.000
seriously.

01:07:06.000 --> 01:07:08.000
All right.

01:07:08.000 --> 01:07:10.000
Maurice, when we finish?

01:07:10.000 --> 01:07:12.000
10? No, no.

01:07:12.000 --> 01:07:14.000
There's a class.

01:07:14.000 --> 01:07:16.000
Do you want to finish at 10 and have our

01:07:16.000 --> 01:07:18.000
or do you want to finish at 5 to 10?

01:07:18.000 --> 01:07:20.000
5 to 10, no?

01:07:20.000 --> 01:07:22.000
5 to 10. All right.

01:07:22.000 --> 01:07:24.000
I'm on the side of a class.

01:07:24.000 --> 01:07:26.000
I studied at Harvard.

01:07:26.000 --> 01:07:28.000
We did yesterday.

01:07:28.000 --> 01:07:30.000
All right.

01:07:30.000 --> 01:07:32.000
Now.

01:07:32.000 --> 01:07:34.000
So what does it mean?

01:07:34.000 --> 01:07:36.000
Enough

01:07:36.000 --> 01:07:38.000
to bring

01:07:38.000 --> 01:07:40.000
somebody down.

01:07:40.000 --> 01:07:42.000
Hispano.

01:07:42.000 --> 01:07:44.000
He wants to bring people down.

01:07:44.000 --> 01:07:46.000
Hispano is what?

01:07:46.000 --> 01:07:48.000
Hispano is hoping.

01:07:48.000 --> 01:07:50.000
Yes. And helecha

01:07:50.000 --> 01:07:52.000
is to calm the person down.

01:07:52.000 --> 01:07:54.000
These people have too much

01:07:54.000 --> 01:07:56.000
money. You must be Jewish,

01:07:56.000 --> 01:07:58.000
no? Are you Jewish?

01:07:58.000 --> 01:08:00.000
You Jews,

01:08:00.000 --> 01:08:02.000
I love Jews, yes?

01:08:02.000 --> 01:08:04.000
But you Jews, you have too much money.

01:08:04.000 --> 01:08:06.000
People in the Bronx

01:08:06.000 --> 01:08:08.000
don't have money. Yes?

01:08:08.000 --> 01:08:10.000
All right? Fine.

01:08:10.000 --> 01:08:12.000
So.

01:08:12.000 --> 01:08:14.000
So right now he's feminine.

01:08:14.000 --> 01:08:16.000
Right now he should be Hispano.

01:08:16.000 --> 01:08:18.000
No.

01:08:18.000 --> 01:08:20.000
Enough? No, no, no, no.

01:08:20.000 --> 01:08:22.000
It's going to the person.

01:08:22.000 --> 01:08:24.000
Yes.

01:08:26.000 --> 01:08:28.000
It's masculine.

01:08:28.000 --> 01:08:30.000
Yes.

01:08:30.000 --> 01:08:32.000
Enough?

01:08:32.000 --> 01:08:34.000
The Hispano

01:08:34.000 --> 01:08:36.000
is to the ab.

01:08:36.000 --> 01:08:38.000
It doesn't say,

01:08:38.000 --> 01:08:40.000
you understand?

01:08:40.000 --> 01:08:42.000
You would be right,

01:08:42.000 --> 01:08:44.000
but it says enough.

01:08:44.000 --> 01:08:46.000
Shelo.

01:08:48.000 --> 01:08:50.000
Hispano

01:08:50.000 --> 01:08:52.000
shelo.

01:08:52.000 --> 01:08:54.000
Hispano is to bring somebody

01:08:54.000 --> 01:08:56.000
down.

01:08:56.000 --> 01:08:58.000
No.

01:08:58.000 --> 01:09:00.000
The ab of shelo.

01:09:00.000 --> 01:09:02.000
The yod vav of shelo.

01:09:02.000 --> 01:09:04.000
That's it.

01:09:04.000 --> 01:09:06.000
All right.

01:09:12.000 --> 01:09:14.000
He stands cool

01:09:14.000 --> 01:09:16.000
like a lion

01:09:16.000 --> 01:09:18.000
waiting for a victim.

01:09:18.000 --> 01:09:20.000
The lion

01:09:20.000 --> 01:09:22.000
in its dam.

01:09:22.000 --> 01:09:24.000
Yes?

01:09:24.000 --> 01:09:26.000
And if people don't come to him,

01:09:30.000 --> 01:09:32.000
he will send his

01:09:32.000 --> 01:09:34.000
reshet and get people.

01:09:34.000 --> 01:09:36.000
He just turns,

01:09:36.000 --> 01:09:38.000
either they come to him,

01:09:40.000 --> 01:09:42.000
or he sends somebody.

01:09:42.000 --> 01:09:44.000
The reshet, the net,

01:09:44.000 --> 01:09:46.000
and he hands him with the net.

01:09:46.000 --> 01:09:48.000
All right?

01:09:50.000 --> 01:09:52.000
It came,

01:09:54.000 --> 01:09:56.000
he would

01:09:56.000 --> 01:09:58.000
smite.

01:09:58.000 --> 01:10:00.000
Wait, wait, one part.

01:10:00.000 --> 01:10:02.000
Oh, did I?

01:10:02.000 --> 01:10:04.000
No.

01:10:04.000 --> 01:10:06.000
I said it.

01:10:06.000 --> 01:10:08.000
Sorry, sorry, sorry.

01:10:08.000 --> 01:10:10.000
All right.

01:10:10.000 --> 01:10:12.000
He would strike.

01:10:12.000 --> 01:10:14.000
He would

01:10:14.000 --> 01:10:16.000
make you

01:10:16.000 --> 01:10:18.000
bow down.

01:10:22.000 --> 01:10:24.000
Kaim.

01:10:24.000 --> 01:10:26.000
And in front of him

01:10:26.000 --> 01:10:28.000
will

01:10:28.000 --> 01:10:30.000
collapse

01:10:30.000 --> 01:10:32.000
the army

01:10:32.000 --> 01:10:34.000
of Kaim.

01:10:34.000 --> 01:10:36.000
Of Kaim means of his victims.

01:10:36.000 --> 01:10:38.000
An army of people will become

01:10:38.000 --> 01:10:40.000
his victim.

01:10:44.000 --> 01:10:46.000
And his opinion,

01:10:46.000 --> 01:10:48.000
he says,

01:10:48.000 --> 01:10:50.000
you know, by the time I die

01:10:50.000 --> 01:10:52.000
and I meet my maker,

01:10:52.000 --> 01:10:54.000
surely God forgot

01:10:54.000 --> 01:10:56.000
all this, what I did.

01:10:56.000 --> 01:10:58.000
He still

01:10:58.000 --> 01:11:00.000
panav.

01:11:00.000 --> 01:11:02.000
As a matter of fact, God

01:11:02.000 --> 01:11:04.000
didn't see what I was doing.

01:11:08.000 --> 01:11:10.000
And he would never

01:11:10.000 --> 01:11:12.000
forgot.

01:11:12.000 --> 01:11:14.000
Yes, he would die,

01:11:14.000 --> 01:11:16.000
eventually I would have to meet my maker,

01:11:16.000 --> 01:11:18.000
but, you know,

01:11:18.000 --> 01:11:20.000
God doesn't pay attention to me.

01:11:20.000 --> 01:11:22.000
And that's the last pasuk we're going to read,

01:11:22.000 --> 01:11:24.000
but it's longer.

01:11:24.000 --> 01:11:26.000
Kuma Adonai.

01:11:26.000 --> 01:11:28.000
Now David Amenek says, stand up, God.

01:11:28.000 --> 01:11:30.000
That you stand from the hope.

01:11:30.000 --> 01:11:32.000
Stand up.

01:11:34.000 --> 01:11:36.000
Raise your hand against these tyrants.

01:11:36.000 --> 01:11:38.000
Al tiskah

01:11:38.000 --> 01:11:40.000
anavim.

01:11:40.000 --> 01:11:42.000
Don't

01:11:42.000 --> 01:11:44.000
forget or forsake

01:11:44.000 --> 01:11:46.000
those people who are

01:11:48.000 --> 01:11:50.000
poor, poor in the sense

01:11:50.000 --> 01:11:52.000
needy, who are the victims

01:11:52.000 --> 01:11:54.000
of these guys.

01:11:54.000 --> 01:11:56.000
And I'm going to

01:11:56.000 --> 01:11:58.000
just one minute.

01:11:58.000 --> 01:12:00.000
I believe

01:12:00.000 --> 01:12:02.000
that because we have

01:12:02.000 --> 01:12:04.000
chapters like this

01:12:04.000 --> 01:12:06.000
in Tehillim,

01:12:06.000 --> 01:12:08.000
that our people,

01:12:08.000 --> 01:12:10.000
those who didn't go to parliament,

01:12:10.000 --> 01:12:12.000
those who did not have to be sophisticated,

01:12:12.000 --> 01:12:14.000
they had a political

01:12:14.000 --> 01:12:16.000
understanding of

01:12:16.000 --> 01:12:18.000
tyranny, of evil,

01:12:18.000 --> 01:12:20.000
of

01:12:20.000 --> 01:12:22.000
regime,

01:12:22.000 --> 01:12:24.000
that made them be

01:12:24.000 --> 01:12:26.000
more careful

01:12:26.000 --> 01:12:28.000
and in the long term, a better

01:12:28.000 --> 01:12:30.000
businessman than the average

01:12:30.000 --> 01:12:32.000
boy, you know, because who

01:12:32.000 --> 01:12:34.000
buys that

01:12:34.000 --> 01:12:36.000
power and

01:12:36.000 --> 01:12:38.000
may

01:12:38.000 --> 01:12:40.000
make somebody

01:12:40.000 --> 01:12:42.000
even though that he speaks

01:12:42.000 --> 01:12:44.000
about God, that's totally

01:12:44.000 --> 01:12:46.000
fearless of God and so on.

01:12:46.000 --> 01:12:48.000
So that's, you know,

01:12:48.000 --> 01:12:50.000
what we

01:12:50.000 --> 01:12:52.000
studied.

01:12:52.000 --> 01:12:54.000
Too long, at least now maybe.

01:12:54.000 --> 01:12:56.000
Why? So we're trying to

01:12:56.000 --> 01:12:58.000
find a short one.

01:12:58.000 --> 01:13:00.000
This is a Rasha

01:13:00.000 --> 01:13:02.000
Is there such thing

01:13:02.000 --> 01:13:04.000
as a Rasha with no name?

01:13:04.000 --> 01:13:06.000
Yes, of course.

01:13:06.000 --> 01:13:08.000
And also

01:13:08.000 --> 01:13:10.000
Tehillim speaks about this.

01:13:10.000 --> 01:13:12.000
But this is here talking about

01:13:12.000 --> 01:13:14.000
the powerful

01:13:14.000 --> 01:13:16.000
Rasha

01:13:16.000 --> 01:13:18.000
that shows, you know,

01:13:18.000 --> 01:13:20.000
this.

01:13:20.000 --> 01:13:22.000
And I want to say

01:13:22.000 --> 01:13:24.000
the truth, you know.

01:13:24.000 --> 01:13:26.000
It is a

01:13:26.000 --> 01:13:28.000
very important

01:13:28.000 --> 01:13:30.000
for us to realize that in Syria,

01:13:30.000 --> 01:13:32.000
Turkey, other places,

01:13:32.000 --> 01:13:34.000
they were not

01:13:34.000 --> 01:13:36.000
really white

01:13:36.000 --> 01:13:38.000
leaders. But it happened to

01:13:38.000 --> 01:13:40.000
be that we have leaders that

01:13:40.000 --> 01:13:42.000
they know how to deal with these people.

01:13:42.000 --> 01:13:44.000
And that's

01:13:44.000 --> 01:13:46.000
why we thrive and so on.

01:13:46.000 --> 01:13:48.000
You cannot

01:13:48.000 --> 01:13:50.000
lead unless you

01:13:50.000 --> 01:13:52.000
have certain understanding

01:13:52.000 --> 01:13:54.000
of

01:13:54.000 --> 01:13:56.000
the

01:13:56.000 --> 01:13:58.000
situation.

01:13:58.000 --> 01:14:00.000
And I want to say something.

01:14:00.000 --> 01:14:02.000
I don't, I'm not

01:14:02.000 --> 01:14:04.000
a politician, but sometimes I read the newspapers and so on,

01:14:04.000 --> 01:14:06.000
and I see that even people of the highest

01:14:06.000 --> 01:14:08.000
levels in America and so on,

01:14:08.000 --> 01:14:10.000
they seem to be

01:14:10.000 --> 01:14:12.000
so

01:14:12.000 --> 01:14:14.000
clever, so naive, so

01:14:14.000 --> 01:14:16.000
you know.

01:14:16.000 --> 01:14:18.000
But again,

01:14:18.000 --> 01:14:20.000
because we were blessed with

01:14:20.000 --> 01:14:22.000
good leaders, that they had

01:14:22.000 --> 01:14:24.000
the will of Allah, our leaders.

01:14:24.000 --> 01:14:26.000
And they understood

01:14:26.000 --> 01:14:28.000
for Him. That's why they were

01:14:28.000 --> 01:14:30.000
able to

01:14:30.000 --> 01:14:32.000
manage.

01:14:32.000 --> 01:14:34.000
Who's going to

01:14:34.000 --> 01:14:36.000
say the Habib?

01:14:36.000 --> 01:14:38.000
I prayed already.

01:14:38.000 --> 01:14:40.000
So I say in the Kaddish,

01:14:40.000 --> 01:14:42.000
somebody wants to say the Habib?

01:14:42.000 --> 01:14:44.000
Who wants to say the Hazzan?

01:14:44.000 --> 01:14:46.000
Maybe Mr. Sultan?

01:14:46.000 --> 01:14:48.000
Yes, come on.

01:14:48.000 --> 01:14:50.000
...

01:14:50.000 --> 01:14:52.000
...

01:14:52.000 --> 01:14:54.000
...

01:14:54.000 --> 01:14:56.000
...

01:14:56.000 --> 01:14:58.000
Go ahead, say the Kaddish and

01:14:58.000 --> 01:15:00.000
the Habib will move.

01:15:00.000 --> 01:15:02.000
You say

01:15:02.000 --> 01:15:04.000
on Israel, go ahead.

01:15:04.000 --> 01:15:06.000
Yes, go ahead.

01:15:06.000 --> 01:15:08.000
...

01:15:08.000 --> 01:15:10.000
Amen.

01:15:10.000 --> 01:15:12.000
Amen.

01:15:12.000 --> 01:15:14.000
...

01:15:14.000 --> 01:15:16.000
Amen.

01:15:16.000 --> 01:15:18.000
...

